setup.body:
Wazuh's web rules read the combined format. If a site logs JSON for another collector, add a second access_log for Wazuh. Define the format once, in a file nginx reads before the server blocks that use it:
log_format jt_combined '$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] "$request" $status $body_bytes_sent "$http_referer" "$http_user_agent" "$sent_http_content_type"';
Then in each server block: access_log /var/log/nginx/<site>.combined.log jt_combined; Run nginx -t before reloading. Behind a CDN, make sure realip is set so $remote_addr is the client.

setup.body_zh:
Wazuh 的網頁規則讀 combined 格式。網站若為其他收集器記 JSON，就為 Wazuh 再加一份 access_log。在 nginx 先讀到的檔案定義一次格式（要早於使用它的 server 區塊）：
log_format jt_combined '$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] "$request" $status $body_bytes_sent "$http_referer" "$http_user_agent" "$sent_http_content_type"';
再於每個 server 區塊加：access_log /var/log/nginx/<site>.combined.log jt_combined; 重新載入前先執行 nginx -t。在 CDN 後面要確認 realip 已設定，$remote_addr 才是真正的用戶端。
